", "title": "Critical incidents and turning points"}, {"id": "f5aab5f9-49a1-4eb1-beb0-df0ecb8256ce", "type": "concept", "title": "Assumptions, biases, and changing interpretations"}, {"id": "12c205b6-cf7c-4769-a89e-5baf6d0761f8", "type": "concept", "title": "Weekly synthesis and goal revision"}], "description": "Reflection helps students convert discomfort, surprise, and growth into learning."}, {"id": "50792d62-770d-4b56-8f9b-2dde48685150", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence and ethics", "children": [{"id": "3cbf1dd5-445a-4624-bed8-9c29b77afc0d", "type": "concept", "title": "Anonymity, consent, and sensitive details"}, {"id": "6540dab9-4673-41d8-b016-d2bfea63c280", "type": "concept", "title": "Quoting and paraphrasing everyday speech"}, {"id": "92a44629-3bfd-4f51-8ef9-f0dc5745278e", "type": "concept", "title": "Avoiding overgeneralization from limited experience"}], "description": "Students learn to write about real people and communities responsibly."}]}, {"id": "daaa2f57-4dc4-4cda-91bf-cedae58bb4ec", "type": "topic", "title": "Research, Service, or Cultural Portfolio Project", "description": "Guides students through a feasible capstone project grounded in host-community context, ethical evidence, and Spanish-language engagement.", "children": [{"id": "34574b8f-86cd-4e83-8e66-700fe027998b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Project design", "children": [{"id": "e32b08de-f31b-44f9-83c7-9688d521995b", "type": "concept", "title": "Research question or service objective"}, {"id": "0c0bc9cf-d6b7-46ba-b5ee-8c2e904e3a66", "type": "concept", "title": "Scope, timeline, language demands, and permissions"}, {"id": "10134255-3637-424a-8917-cb021576f2fa", "type": "concept", "title": "Primary and secondary source plan"}], "description": "Students choose a project that is feasible, ethical, and grounded in the host context."}, {"id": "9b0e3107-7021-4cad-affe-814ddbb7c9a8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence collection", "children": [{"id": "e2a805ad-6171-468e-9b2a-c8573004d6